{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台『墓場、女子高生』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16公演、完走致しました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/10/25/0407611/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日野陽子の思いを受け止めて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうにか伝わらないように、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、彼女の覚悟と正義が届くように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの墓場で過ごした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"清々しくて虚しくておぞましい時間、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなに酷でどんなに幸せだったのか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台上は冷房かなんかで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し冷えてて煙たくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時々風が吹いたりしてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"墓場にいたんだなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう行けないと思うと寂しくなります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/10/25/0407611/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日野はいつだって自分と闘って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"消化して結論を出していました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不条理だったとしても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは彼女の美学であり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"彼女なりの正義なのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日野としてこの作品と向き合えたことは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからの自分にとって大きい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のしっと重たいものを持ちつつ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くそまじめに楽しめました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"必要で、望んでいることだった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未熟ながらも舞台で息をしている時間って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちばん幸せだなーと、思えた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福原さん、丸尾さん、スタッフの皆様、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みのすけさん、加瀬澤さん、もう中さん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"柿丸さん、メンバーのみんな、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん助けられました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にお疲れ様でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご来場 ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/10/25/0407611/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近うれしかった話"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"墓女会にて餃子包むの褒められたこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい餃子包みたい気分だよ！いま！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/10/25/0407611/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突っ走った分、喉にきてしまった、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会、後半話せなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台やライブの感想ありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/10/25/0407611/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"センター奈々未の卒業シングルとなる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16th「サヨナラの意味」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミュージックビデオ公開中！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"贅！沢！参加できて良かった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画『Anniversary』全国順次公開。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"27日、トークイベント登壇します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうぞよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}